<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY FIVE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HOPMAN CUP RESULTS, DAY FIVE.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the fifth day of the Hopman Cup mixed teams tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Romania beat Germany 3-0</p>
<p>Singles</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea beat Petra Begerow 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea beat Bernd Karbacher 2-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Voinea/Spirlea beat Karbacher/Begerow 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
